steps.text:
{
  "version": 1,
  "summary": "登录入口是 POST /api/auth：SSO 用户走外部 SSO 换票，本地用户按当前月份查询启用用户、校验密码，并在成功或密码错误时写登录事件及发送 MQ 通知。",
  "coverage_note": "已检索 web、service、auth、repo、notification 及 mapper XML；外部 SSO 实现、MQ 的真实连接细节和运行时配置未在当前源码中确认。",
  "context": {
    "question": "登录逻辑怎么实现的？调用了什么，被什么调用？读写哪些表？",
    "scope": "src/main/java/com/example/portal/web/AuthController.java；src/main/java/com/example/portal/service/AuthService.java；src/main/java/com/example/portal/repo/UserRepository.java；src/main/resources/mapper/UserRepository.xml；src/main/java/com/example/portal/auth/*；src/main/java/com/example/portal/notification/*；搜索词 login、登录、AuthService、authenticate、exchangeToken、portal.auth.mode"
  },
  "findings": [
    {
      "text": "HTTP 登录入口为 AuthController 的 POST /api/auth，接收 AuthRequest 的 username/password，调用 AuthService.authenticate，并将 AuthResult 转换为 AuthResponse 返回。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:4dccc80e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "AuthService.authenticate 首先判断 username 是否非空且以 sso: 开头；满足时去掉前缀，将剩余字符串作为 SSO ticket，连同原始密码调用 SsoAuthPort.exchangeToken，直接返回其 AuthResult，不进入本地用户表查询流程。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "condition": "username != null && username.startsWith(\"sso:\")",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:bb2de8df",
        "sr1:03c3359b"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "本地登录流程使用当前日期生成 YYYYMM 格式的 month，然后调用 UserRepository.findActive(month, username) 查询启用用户。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "condition": "未命中 SSO 分支",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:bb2de8df",
        "sr1:72eb033a"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "如果用户查询结果为 null，则抛出“用户不存在或已停用”，该分支在已读取代码中不会写登录事件，也不会发送登录结果通知。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "condition": "user == null",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:bb2de8df"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "本地密码校验是比较数据库返回的 passwordHash 与 credentialChecker.hash(password) 的结果；CredentialChecker 有 LocalCredentialChecker 和 LegacyCredentialChecker 两个实现，运行时由 portal.auth.mode 决定实际注入哪个实现。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:bb2de8df",
        "sr1:77735f96",
        "sr1:bceb96cb",
        "sr1:0e4a18e5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "密码错误时先向按月分表的登录事件表插入 BAD_PASSWORD 记录，再发送 auth.login.failed MQ 事件，最后抛出“用户名或密码错误”。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "condition": "user.passwordHash() 不等于 credentialChecker.hash(password)",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:bb2de8df",
        "sr1:f2e0f5da",
        "sr1:d89a547e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "密码正确时向按月分表的登录事件表插入 SUCCESS 记录，发送 auth.login.succeeded MQ 事件，并返回 token-{user.id()} 形式的 AuthResult，且 fromSso 为 false。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "condition": "密码校验通过",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:bb2de8df",
        "sr1:f2e0f5da",
        "sr1:d89a547e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "UserRepository.findActive 的明确 SQL 是从 portal_user_${month} 读取 id、username、password_hash，条件为 username = #{username} 且 status = 1。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:f2e0f5da"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "UserRepository.insertLoginEvent 的明确 SQL 是向 portal_login_event_${month} 插入 username、result、created_at，created_at 使用 NOW()；result 在当前登录流程中为 BAD_PASSWORD 或 SUCCESS。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:f2e0f5da",
        "sr1:bb2de8df"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "portal_user_${month} 和 portal_login_event_${month} 都是运行时按月份拼接的动态物理表名，因此源码无法确认某一次运行对应的唯一具体表名，例如 portal_user_202609。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:bb2de8df",
        "sr1:f2e0f5da"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "登录结果通知通过 LoginNotifier 抽象发送；当前可见实现 MqLoginNotifier 将成功和失败分别发布到 auth.login.succeeded 与 auth.login.failed，真实 MQ 连接实现未在源码中展开。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:2542bd61",
        "sr1:d89a547e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "当前读取范围内未发现登录流程使用缓存或会话存储；本地成功分支仅构造 token-{user.id()} 字符串，未看到 token 持久化。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:bb2de8df"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "callers": [
    {
      "name": "AuthController.authenticate",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/portal/web/AuthController.java",
      "detail": "POST /api/auth 接收请求后直接调用 AuthService.authenticate(request.username(), request.password())。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:4dccc80e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "外部 HTTP/客户端调用者",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/portal/web/AuthController.java",
      "detail": "通过 POST /api/auth 进入；具体上游客户端未在当前源码中展示。",
      "kind": "candidate",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:4dccc80e"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "callees": [
    {
      "name": "SsoAuthPort.exchangeToken",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/portal/auth/SsoAuthPort.java",
      "detail": "SSO 用户分支调用，传入去掉 sso: 前缀的 ticket 和原始密码；具体外部服务调用方式未实现于当前可见源码。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:bb2de8df",
        "sr1:03c3359b"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "UserRepository.findActive",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/portal/repo/UserRepository.java",
      "detail": "本地登录时读取当前月份的启用用户及密码哈希。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:bb2de8df",
        "sr1:72eb033a"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "CredentialChecker.hash",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/portal/auth/CredentialChecker.java",
      "detail": "对输入密码计算比较值；具体使用 LocalCredentialChecker 还是 LegacyCredentialChecker 由 portal.auth.mode 决定。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:bb2de8df",
        "sr1:77735f96"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "UserRepository.insertLoginEvent",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/portal/repo/UserRepository.java",
      "detail": "密码错误和密码正确两个本地分支都会调用，分别写入 BAD_PASSWORD 或 SUCCESS。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:bb2de8df",
        "sr1:72eb033a"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoginNotifier.notifyFailedLogin / notifyLoginSucceeded",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/portal/notification/LoginNotifier.java",
      "detail": "密码错误和成功分支分别发送失败或成功登录通知；当前实现为 MqLoginNotifier。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:bb2de8df",
        "sr1:2542bd61",
        "sr1:d89a547e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "MqLoginNotifier.publish",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/portal/notification/MqLoginNotifier.java",
      "detail": "将登录事件发布到 MQ；样例源码只表达边界，未提供真实连接细节。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:d89a547e"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "data_accesses": [
    {
      "object": "portal_user_${month}",
      "category": "db_object",
      "operations": [
        "read"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "仅本地登录路径访问",
        "按当前月份生成 month",
        "username 匹配且 status = 1"
      ],
      "access_method": "UserRepository.findActive；SELECT id, username, password_hash FROM portal_user_${month} WHERE username = #{username} AND status = 1",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:f2e0f5da",
        "sr1:bb2de8df"
      ]
    },
    {
      "object": "portal_login_event_${month}",
      "category": "db_object",
      "operations": [
        "insert"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "本地用户存在且密码错误时插入 result = BAD_PASSWORD",
        "本地用户存在且密码正确时插入 result = SUCCESS",
        "用户不存在或已停用分支未看到该插入"
      ],
      "access_method": "UserRepository.insertLoginEvent；INSERT INTO portal_login_event_${month} (username, result, created_at) VALUES (#{username}, #{result}, NOW())",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:f2e0f5da",
        "sr1:bb2de8df"
      ]
    },
    {
      "object": "SsoAuthPort.exchangeToken / 外部 SSO 服务",
      "category": "external",
      "operations": [
        "read",
        "unknown"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "username 以 sso: 开头时"
      ],
      "access_method": "ssoAuthPort.exchangeToken(username.substring(4), password)",
      "state": {
        "type": "unknown"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:bb2de8df",
        "sr1:03c3359b"
      ]
    },
    {
      "object": "MQ routing key auth.login.succeeded",
      "category": "message",
      "operations": [
        "insert"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "本地密码校验成功时"
      ],
      "access_method": "MqLoginNotifier.notifyLoginSucceeded -> publish(\"auth.login.succeeded\", username)",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:d89a547e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "object": "MQ routing key auth.login.failed",
      "category": "message",
      "operations": [
        "insert"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "本地用户存在但密码错误时"
      ],
      "access_method": "MqLoginNotifier.notifyFailedLogin -> publish(\"auth.login.failed\", username)",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:d89a547e"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "title": "接收登录请求",
      "detail": "POST /api/auth 接收 username 和 password。",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:4dccc80e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "title": "判断 SSO 或本地登录",
      "detail": "检查 username 是否以 sso: 开头。",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:bb2de8df"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "title": "调用 SSO 换票",
      "detail": "去掉 sso: 前缀后调用 SsoAuthPort.exchangeToken 并直接返回结果。",
      "source_ids": [
